Description: Rikkahub desktop LLM chat client for Linux
 Native LLM client with multi-provider support (OpenAI / Anthropic /
 Gemini / OpenAI-compatible endpoints), MCP tools, web search, image
 generation and local model support (Ollama / LM Studio / llama.cpp).
 Runs a local server at http://localhost:8080 and opens the UI in
 your default browser. Data is stored in
 ~/.local/share/rikkahub-desktop (override: RIKKAHUB_PC_DATA_DIR).
